  "text": "Intake note (Commercial team, 07/04/2020). Our client Pooja Khan is a 41-year-old retired bank officer who lives at Bungalow 21, Sitabuldi, Nagpur 440004 and can be reached on +91 71729 68809 or pooja.khan@example.in. The client's PAN TDAPK1562Z.\nThe client consulted us about a cheque bounce matter against M/s Das Traders. A cheque for 12 lakh rupees issued by Das Traders bounced: the drawer stopped the cheque with a stop-payment instruction.\nThe cheque was deposited in the client's account no. 343257224531 (IFSC KKBK0957952).\nThe matter was filed as S.C.C. No. 2252/2020 before the Judicial Magistrate First Class Court at Nagpur on 13/08/2020.",
